        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tina and Bobby\n- People: Bobby Moore, Tina Moore, Pelé, Alan Mullery\n- Organizations: ITV, Fulham, England, West Ham\n- Events: 1975 FA Cup Final\n- Topics: football, television\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Moore was widely regarded as one of the greatest defenders of all time.\n- Pelé cited Bobby Moore as the greatest defender he had ever played against.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Fulham's team included former England captains Bobby Moore and Alan Mullery.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Bobby Moore was a former West Ham captain and made his last appearance at Wembley.\n- Tina and Bobby is a British television series based on the relationship between footballer Bobby Moore and Tina Moore.\n- Tina and Bobby was first broadcast as a three-part series on ITV on 13 January 2017.",
